WhatsApp formatting samples

*Bold text*
_Italic text_
~Strikethrough text~
`Inline monospace`

> This is a quote

* First item
* Second item

- First item
- Second item

1. First item
2. Second item

Triple-backtick monospace examples:

``` multiline monospace starts on opening line
continues here
```

```no-space-after-opening
continues here
```

``` starts and ends on the same line```

```
starts on the next line and closes here```

before ```monospace in the middle``` after

Inside triple-backtick monospace, formatting must remain inactive:

```
*not bold*
_not italic_
~not struck through~
`not inline monospace`
> not a quote
* not a list
1. not an enumeration
```
